# App-level Tone3000 publishable key (OAuth client_id). One value for all users.
# Create it in your Tone3000 account settings (https://www.tone3000.com/api — "Generate your keys in settings").
# Copy the Publishable Key here. Do not put the Secret Key (t3k_cs_…) in this file.
# Also register these redirect URIs in those settings:
#   http://localhost:1420/
#   https://staging.gpstudio.patocorrenti.com/
#   https://gpstudio.patocorrenti.com/
# Copy this file to .env.local and restart `npm run dev`. An empty value hides the Tone3000 control.
VITE_TONE3000_CLIENT_ID=
